# An allowlist: only what the Dockerfile COPYs reaches the build context. No data, secrets, .env, .git or notes.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!tests
!scripts
!extension/shortcuts
!extension/chrome
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
# signed Shortcuts carry the signer's Apple certificate; the tests skip without them
**/*.shortcut
